From 0a832afd6a328b55bc5f2c2be0239b0dcea4005f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: anyingiit <49945850+anyingiit@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 20:45:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Update documentation references to RFC 9987

The SSH agent protocol was published as RFC 9987. Point the crate
documentation, code comments and README at the RFC instead of
draft-miller-ssh-agent-14 (section 3.x of the draft is section 5.x of
the RFC).

While here:
- fix the section label of the session-bind extension link, which said
  8.8.1 while the URL already pointed at 8.1.1;
- cite RFC 9987 section 5.1 (not 4.1) in the unknown-request test and
  quote the RFC wording;
- point the key constraint decoder comment at the constraint type
  registry (section 8.2) instead of draft-12.

Refs #116

Signed-off-by: anyingiit <49945850+anyingiit@users.noreply.github.com>
